        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sodium percarbonate, powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sodium percarbonate, powder, at plant
data based on company information for a former detergent study of EMPA;
CAS number: 015630-89-4; 
UUID: 33c61a93-f37a-3203-9d0d-dad895dc69a3
This module contains material and energy input, production of waste and emissions for the production of sodium percarbonate. Transport and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Crystallization out of a aquous solution of soda and hydrogen peroxide, representing average technology for the mid 90s
Time period: year of reported data
Production volume: na
Sampling: company data 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_33c61a93-f37a-3203-9d0d-dad895dc69a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
